# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit the filled-in file.
# Both values come from the Supabase dashboard:
#   Project "The Corporate" -> Project Settings -> API
# The same two variables must be set in the Netlify dashboard before the first
# deploy (Site configuration -> Environment variables), because Vite inlines
# them into the client bundle at build time.
#
# The anon/publishable key is public by design — it ships inside the JavaScript
# bundle and is visible to anyone. It is safe only because RLS is enabled on
# every table. Never disable RLS. The service role key is NOT used by this
# build and must never appear in any VITE_ variable or any committed file.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
